{"id":"440235","name":"土豆丝韭菜汤","author":"政妈妈","authorId":"210653","desc":"","cover":"images/440235/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"土豆","amount":"2个"},{"name":"韭菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"猪肉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"味极鲜酱油","amount":"1勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"猪肉切丝备用。","img":"images/440235/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"韭菜摘洗干净，切段。","img":"images/440235/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"土豆去皮洗净擦成丝。","img":"images/440235/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅里油热加入肉丝煸炒。","img":"images/440235/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入土豆丝翻炒。","img":"images/440235/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入酱油翻炒。","img":"images/440235/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入适量水炖煮。","img":"images/440235/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"煮开后加入韭菜翻炒。","img":"images/440235/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"最后加入盐调匀即可。","img":"images/440235/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/440235/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/440235/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"猪肉最好选择瘦肉比较好吃。可以把韭菜换成别的蔬菜。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}